prompt:
Listen to the entire attached audio, a product demonstration soundtrack.
Review actual sound, not hypothetical properties. No script is supplied.
Give JSON with: coverage_seconds; speech_language; speakers; first_sentence;
last_sentence; intelligibility (clear/partly_unclear/unclear); music_present;
music_balance (quiet_under_speech/masking/too_loud/inaudible); pacing;
observed_audio_defects (array of exact timestamp, observation, severity);
ending_complete (boolean); ending_observation; transcript (complete verbatim
spoken words); verdict (pass/revise); limitations. Check natural pronunciation,
missing words, clipped consonants, distortion, abrupt cuts and whether the music
masks speech. Do not invent problems. Do not claim to have watched visuals.
Do not treat a spoken marketing claim as verified implementation evidence.
